warning[identical_case_bodies]: `case .JPEG` does the same as `case .PNG`
  --> tests/lint/identical_case_bodies/bad.jai:15:9
   |
15 |         case .JPEG;
   |         ^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: list the values together: `case .PNG, .JPEG;`
   |
13 -         case .PNG;
14 -             return "image";
15 -         case .JPEG;
16 -             return "image";
13 +         case .PNG, .JPEG;
14 +             return "image";
   |

